  "notes": "The candidate program version optimizes the bucket sort algorithm by improving memory locality and loop order. The loops have been reordered to enhance cache performance, and the data layout has been adjusted to use contiguous memory for bucket data. Additionally, OpenMP pragmas have been added to parallelize the sorting of buckets, which can lead to better performance on multi-core systems."
